    exported.append(archive);links.append('<a href="'+archive.name+'">Complete preserved first memory unknown</a>')
    doc+='<section id="evidence"><h2>Complete frozen evidence</h2><p>'+' · '.join(links)+'</p><p>For each lane the export includes the entire original and compact catalogs, full fixed-point ranks/edges, every retained alternative, the complete six-row prospective point model and every receptor-family pilot. The independent auditor enumerates all substitutions by Cartesian products with a reverse occurrence index, reconstructs minimal ranks with a separate worklist algorithm, regenerates every scalar point candidate, and checks each eight-placement aggregate literally. Every original and compact local definition passes independent host logical replay. No prospective native-admission token is fabricated, and the geometry object deliberately refuses proof decode.</p><p>All 137 files in the earlier 99+7+31 milestone exports remain byte-identical. This reader is a separate feasibility milestone. Publication and final live visual QA are parent-owned.</p></section>'
    payload=json.dumps(families,separators=(',',':')).replace('<','\\u003c');doc+='<script id="family-data" type="application/json">'+payload+'</script>'+r'''<script>const families=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('family-data').textContent),select=document.getElementById('family-choice'),view=document.getElementById('family-view');for(let i=0;i<families.length;i++){let o=document.createElement('option');o.value=i;o.textContent=families[i].label;select.append(o)}function render(){let f=families[Number(select.value)||0];if(!f)return;view.replaceChildren();let p=document.createElement('p');p.className='formula';p.textContent='Closed lemma root: \\('+f.root_formula+'\\).';view.append(p);p=document.createElement('p');p.className='formula';p.textContent='External receptor required: \\('+f.external_formula+'\\).';view.append(p);p=document.createElement('p');p.className='formula';p.textContent='Rewrite output: \\('+f.output_formula+'\\).';view.append(p);p=document.createElement('p');p.textContent='This generic local interface has '+f.local_commands+' primitive commands; new native admission remains pending.';view.append(p);let d=document.createElement('details'),s=document.createElement('summary'),pre=document.createElement('pre');s.textContent='Exact eight base placements, occupancy and extended marks';pre.textContent=JSON.stringify(f.aggregate,null,2);d.append(s,pre);view.append(d);d=document.createElement('details');s=document.createElement('summary');s.textContent='Authored generic local primitive interface';pre=document.createElement('pre');pre.textContent=JSON.stringify(f.definition,null,2);d.append(s,pre);view.append(d);if(window.MathJax&&MathJax.typesetPromise)MathJax.typesetPromise([view])}select.addEventListener('change',render);window.addEventListener('load',render);</script></main></body></html>'''
